# Image Assets Folder

This folder contains all image assets for the Beauty Clinic theme.

## Setup Instructions

Please refer to `/public/images/README.md` for detailed specifications and setup guide.

## Quick Start

1. Download high-quality photos from Unsplash, Pexels, or Pixabay
2. Rename according to specifications
3. Optimize using TinyPNG or Squoosh
4. Place in appropriate subfolders

For complete guide, see: `IMAGE-SETUP-GUIDE.md` in the root directory.
